      * Characterization suite generated for DISCOUNT (external mode).
      * Covers tier limits, truncation and overwriting of the outputs.
       TESTSUITE DISCOUNTAI 'DISCOUNT: limits, truncation and outputs'

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  T-AMOUNT                  PIC 9(7)V99.
       01  T-RESULT                  PIC 9(7)V99.
       01  T-CATEGORY.
           05  T-CAT-HEAD            PIC X(5).
           05  T-CAT-TAIL            PIC X(5).

       BEFORE-EACH
           MOVE ZERO TO T-AMOUNT
           MOVE 1234567.89 TO T-RESULT
           MOVE ALL 'X' TO T-CATEGORY
       END-BEFORE

       TESTCASE 'exact limit 1000 is premium'
           MOVE 1000 TO T-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING T-AMOUNT T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 800
           EXPECT T-CATEGORY TO BE 'PREMIUM'

       TESTCASE 'just below 1000 is standard'
           MOVE 999.99 TO T-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING T-AMOUNT T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
      * REVIEW: 999.99 - 99.999 = 899.991; without ROUNDED it truncates.
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 899.99
           EXPECT T-CATEGORY TO BE 'STANDARD'

       TESTCASE 'exact limit 500 is standard'
           MOVE 500 TO T-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING T-AMOUNT T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 450
           EXPECT T-CATEGORY TO BE 'STANDARD'

       TESTCASE 'just below 500 is basic'
           MOVE 499.99 TO T-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING T-AMOUNT T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 499.99
           EXPECT T-CATEGORY TO BE 'BASIC'

       TESTCASE 'zero amount is basic and the result is zero'
           MOVE 0 TO T-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING T-AMOUNT T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE ZEROS
           EXPECT T-CATEGORY TO BE 'BASIC'

       TESTCASE 'smallest positive amount 0.01'
           MOVE 0.01 TO T-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING T-AMOUNT T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 0.01
           EXPECT T-CATEGORY TO BE 'BASIC'

       TESTCASE 'largest amount the PIC holds is premium'
           MOVE 9999999.99 TO T-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING T-AMOUNT T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
      * REVIEW: 9999999.99 * 0.80 = 7999999.992; it is truncated.
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 7999999.99
           EXPECT T-CATEGORY TO BE 'PREMIUM'

       TESTCASE 'standard truncates the third decimal'
           MOVE 555.55 TO T-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING T-AMOUNT T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
      * REVIEW: 555.55 - 55.555 = 499.995; without ROUNDED, 499.99.
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 499.99
           EXPECT T-CATEGORY TO BE 'STANDARD'

       TESTCASE 'premium truncates the third decimal'
           MOVE 1234.56 TO T-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING T-AMOUNT T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
      * REVIEW: 1234.56 - 246.912 = 987.648; without ROUNDED, 987.64.
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 987.64
           EXPECT T-CATEGORY TO BE 'PREMIUM'

       TESTCASE 'standard 700 gets the actual 10%'
           MOVE 700 TO T-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING T-AMOUNT T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 630
           EXPECT T-CATEGORY TO BE 'STANDARD'

       TESTCASE 'previous category is replaced and space-padded'
           MOVE 100 TO T-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING T-AMOUNT T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
           EXPECT T-CAT-HEAD TO BE 'BASIC'
           EXPECT T-CAT-TAIL TO BE SPACES
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 100

       TESTCASE 'the input amount is not modified'
           MOVE 2500 TO T-AMOUNT
           CALL "DISCOUNT" USING T-AMOUNT T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
           EXPECT T-AMOUNT TO BE NUMERIC 2500
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 2000
           EXPECT T-CATEGORY TO BE 'PREMIUM'
